  "analysis": "Extractor now produces the required artifacts in /app/output with corrected JSON top-level keys (items), CSV header includes exception_reason with two-decimal amount formatting, and reconciliation_report.jsonl is produced. Remaining concern: exceptions builder mutates items and strips _meta only for exceptions; currently transactions.json shows exception_reason set, implying items were mutated before writing (OK) but we must ensure _meta is removed from all rows before writing transactions.json/csv (currently buildExceptions deletes _meta only while iterating items and returns filtered; it does delete for all rows, so OK). Another concern: sections.js contains regex literal `^##\\s+...` with `\\s` sequences in a regex literal; it will be interpreted as `\s` (fine). We should quickly confirm transactions.json contains no _meta fields anywhere and that reconciliation_report.jsonl is sorted by notice_id ascending (it appears so). Also validate cli missing args already handled. If everything matches handbook, task is complete.",
